# HOW TO ACTIVATE reCAPTCHA ON LIVE PRODUCTION:
# Step 1: Upload all updated project files (.env, config.env, includes/, submit-booking.php, submit-application.php, pages/) to your live server.
# Step 2: On your live server config.env, set ENVIRONMENT=production (or leave blank).
# Step 3: Ensure your live domain (maiditeasy.co.in) is added in your Google reCAPTCHA Admin Console (https://www.google.com/recaptcha/admin).
# Note: On production domain, Google reCAPTCHA checkbox will display automatically and enforce verification on all forms. On localhost, reCAPTCHA is automatically hidden so forms submit without errors.

